This project builds on, and does not vendor, work by others:

  - GLEIF's vLEI ecosystem — the ACDC credential schemas (WebOfTrust/vLEI) and
    the verification service (GLEIF-IT/vlei-verifier), used as published.
  - keripy (WebOfTrust) — KERI identifiers, key event logs and credential
    issuance, used through its command-line interface.
  - The Model Context Protocol and its Python SDK (modelcontextprotocol).
    This project does not modify the core schema; it adds types in the fields
    that specification already reserves for extensions.

The root of trust in this repository's demonstration environment is
self-configured. In production it would be GLEIF's.
